      <abstract>&#xA;&lt;p&gt;SIPSIMPLE SDK&lt;/p&gt;      </abstract>
      <description>&#xA;&lt;p&gt;SIPSIMPLE SDK is the heart of Blink SIP client. The library implements audio calls, audio conferencing, MSRP chat and file transfer, XCAP document management, presence...&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;The talk will go though the implementation of a simple SIP client using the library with live coding examples.&lt;/p&gt;      </description>
